{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879340",
      "title": "Passing Data with Route Params (Dynamic Segments)",
      "lectureOrder": 174,
      "videoOrder": 151,
      "sourceHash": "ff1b1fd6d10eacc746172f38f8270801a2eabfdaa3a6360c283aa684aa057f85",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.14,
          "end": 4.86,
          "en": "So now added navigation in different forms,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.86,
          "end": 6.89,
          "en": "it's time to explore more things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.89,
          "end": 10.2,
          "en": "we can configure here on our route configurations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.2,
          "end": 12.7,
          "en": "And there's one especially important feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.7,
          "end": 14.51,
          "en": "which you need in many apps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.51,
          "end": 16.4,
          "en": "which you're going to build.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.4,
          "end": 19.6,
          "en": "We get this team members component here, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.6,
          "end": 22.52,
          "en": "And in this team members component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.52,
          "end": 24.49,
          "en": "I wanna render the different members",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.49,
          "end": 27.02,
          "en": "of a team we selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.02,
          "end": 29.31,
          "en": "now at the moment, this is kind of a dummy component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.31,
          "end": 31.04,
          "en": "which we're not even using.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.04,
          "end": 33.31,
          "en": "It has some built in dummy data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.31,
          "end": 36.24,
          "en": "and we're not rendering this component anywhere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.24,
          "end": 37.7,
          "en": "Now a common scenario,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 37.7,
          "end": 39.83,
          "en": "which you have in many apps is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.83,
          "end": 42.12,
          "en": "that you might have another route here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.43,
          "end": 46.3,
          "en": "for a path of /teams.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.3,
          "end": 48.45,
          "en": "But now not just that path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 48.45,
          "end": 50.11,
          "en": "we already have a route for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 50.11,
          "end": 52.42,
          "en": "and you should only have one route per path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 52.42,
          "end": 55.81,
          "en": "and instead we use /teams/",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 55.81,
          "end": 59.143,
          "en": "and now we want to have some dynamic ID here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.5,
          "end": 65.33,
          "en": "So did we support pops like teams T1,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.33,
          "end": 68.52,
          "en": "if T1 would be a team ID or a T2",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.52,
          "end": 72.7,
          "en": "and we would load the same component with different data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.7,
          "end": 74.83,
          "en": "for these different teams.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.83,
          "end": 79.83,
          "en": "So we need a dynamic route with a so-called route parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.7,
          "end": 83.68,
          "en": "and that's a feature supported by the view router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.68,
          "end": 88.47,
          "en": "You can define a dynamic path segment by adding a colon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.47,
          "end": 90.23,
          "en": "and then any name of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.23,
          "end": 92.69,
          "en": "For example, team ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.69,
          "end": 95.77000000000001,
          "en": "Now that means that this route will become active",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.77000000000001,
          "end": 100.77000000000001,
          "en": "if the user enters /teams and then anything thereafter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.49000000000001,
          "end": 104.06,
          "en": "therefore the order matters by the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.06,
          "end": 108.93,
          "en": "if you had another route here /teams/new,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.93,
          "end": 112.7,
          "en": "so not a dynamic segment, but simply the text new,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.7,
          "end": 116.75999999999999,
          "en": "you should put this first because otherwise this path here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.75999999999999,
          "end": 119.13,
          "en": "this route would match this route as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.13,
          "end": 122.74,
          "en": "because new would be interpreted as a team ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.74,
          "end": 124.56,
          "en": "Now we don't need the new route here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.56,
          "end": 127.03,
          "en": "I just wanted to make you aware of this and make",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 127.03,
          "end": 130.14,
          "en": "you aware of how these different routes will be parsed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.14,
          "end": 132.03,
          "en": "and prioritized.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 132.03,
          "end": 133.69,
          "en": "Here we don't need this new route though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.69,
          "end": 136.85,
          "en": "but we want to set up this dynamic route here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.85,
          "end": 139.6,
          "en": "with the dynamic route parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.6,
          "end": 142.97,
          "en": "So here I wanna load a component and the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 142.97,
          "end": 145.09,
          "en": "that should be loaded is a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 145.09,
          "end": 149.36,
          "en": "we need to import the team members component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.36,
          "end": 154.36,
          "en": "from /components/teams/teamMembers.Vue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.31,
          "end": 159.563,
          "en": "that's the component that should be loaded here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.57999999999998,
          "end": 164.57999999999998,
          "en": "And with that, if we now save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.57999999999998,
          "end": 169.57999999999998,
          "en": "we can enter teams/T1 and reload this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.95,
          "end": 172.63,
          "en": "the same for anything here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.63,
          "end": 173.99,
          "en": "It's always the same component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 173.99,
          "end": 178.31,
          "en": "because anything after teams/ will be interpreted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.31,
          "end": 181.373,
          "en": "as a value for this dynamic segment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.35,
          "end": 183.183,
          "en": "Now at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 183.183,
          "end": 186.23,
          "en": "it's always the same component with the same dummy data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 186.23,
          "end": 190.06,
          "en": "but now we can change this because we will get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.06,
          "end": 191.89,
          "en": "to this concrete value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.89,
          "end": 194.89,
          "en": "which is used for this route parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.89,
          "end": 196.5,
          "en": "for displace holder here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 196.5,
          "end": 198.85,
          "en": "We can get access for the concrete value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.85,
          "end": 202.18,
          "en": "the user entered inside off the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.18,
          "end": 203.38,
          "en": "that is being loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 203.38,
          "end": 205.593,
          "en": "So inside of team members,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.6,
          "end": 210.17000000000002,
          "en": "I don't want to use my dummy team data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.17000000000002,
          "end": 213.16,
          "en": "Instead, we do have dummy team data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.16,
          "end": 215.93,
          "en": "for all teams to find an app view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.93,
          "end": 220.17000000000002,
          "en": "Here we got teams and we got users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 220.17000000000002,
          "end": 223.57,
          "en": "And for every team we have a list of members.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.57,
          "end": 225.57,
          "en": "Now, my idea is simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 225.57,
          "end": 229.68,
          "en": "When one of these free supported team Ids",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 229.68,
          "end": 231.35,
          "en": "is being entered here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 232.5,
          "end": 237.38,
          "en": "in the URL after teams as a value for this route parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 237.38,
          "end": 239.81,
          "en": "I wanna load the appropriate team,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 239.81,
          "end": 242.52,
          "en": "find out which members we have in that team",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 242.52,
          "end": 245.98,
          "en": "and also load the appropriate users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 245.98,
          "end": 248.3,
          "en": "Now we are already providing teams",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 248.3,
          "end": 250.52,
          "en": "and users here in app view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 250.52,
          "end": 253.9,
          "en": "So we can inject both in team members",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 253.9,
          "end": 255.55,
          "en": "and we'll need to do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 255.55,
          "end": 257.563,
          "en": "So that we, get access to that data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 258.41,
          "end": 263.41,
          "en": "So here I will add inject and inject users and teams.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 266.27,
          "end": 269.57,
          "en": "Now we just need a way of getting access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 269.57,
          "end": 272.88,
          "en": "to this dynamic segment, the user entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 272.88,
          "end": 275.45,
          "en": "So to the concrete value that was entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 275.45,
          "end": 277.78,
          "en": "for this route parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 277.78,
          "end": 282.63,
          "en": "and we could do it as in the created lifecycle hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 282.63,
          "end": 285.27,
          "en": "That will be called when the component is created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 285.27,
          "end": 287.04,
          "en": "before it's shown on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 287.04,
          "end": 289.77,
          "en": "But once all the data is available,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 289.77,
          "end": 292.27,
          "en": "so here in created,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 292.27,
          "end": 295.03,
          "en": "we can now get access to the inject the data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 295.03,
          "end": 299.69,
          "en": "but also, and that's the good thing to our routing data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 299.69,
          "end": 303.16,
          "en": "And for this, we got another special property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 303.16,
          "end": 304.53,
          "en": "which is available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 304.53,
          "end": 308.9,
          "en": "We saw $router, which gave us access to the overall router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 308.9,
          "end": 311.22,
          "en": "We also have $route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 311.22,
          "end": 313.083,
          "en": "So without an r at the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 314.1,
          "end": 317.38,
          "en": "the route is available in this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 317.38,
          "end": 320.35,
          "en": "because this component is loaded through the router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 320.35,
          "end": 322.88,
          "en": "and then the route gives us access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 322.88,
          "end": 325.21,
          "en": "to various pieces of information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 325.21,
          "end": 328.13,
          "en": "For example, to the path that was responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 328.13,
          "end": 329.55,
          "en": "for loading this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 329.55,
          "end": 333.42,
          "en": "which in this case would be something like /teams",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 333.42,
          "end": 335.053,
          "en": "and then the concrete team id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 336.07,
          "end": 339.49,
          "en": "So we could parse the team id from that path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 339.49,
          "end": 341.193,
          "en": "but we don't even have to do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 342.33,
          "end": 346.46,
          "en": "We have another property available, the parent's property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 346.46,
          "end": 349.15999999999997,
          "en": "This holds all the route parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 349.15999999999997,
          "end": 352.2,
          "en": "that were used for getting to this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 352.2,
          "end": 356.01,
          "en": "And in this case, we have one route parameter for this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 356.01,
          "end": 359.82,
          "en": "Everything that starts a colon here is a route parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 359.82,
          "end": 362.76,
          "en": "And the name you chose here will be the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 362.76,
          "end": 366.11,
          "en": "by which you can extract the value provided by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 366.11,
          "end": 368.31,
          "en": "So in my case, the name is teamId.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 368.31,
          "end": 369.87,
          "en": "And hence here in team members,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 369.87,
          "end": 371.763,
          "en": "I can access params.teamId.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 373.75,
          "end": 376.94,
          "en": "If you chose a different name in your routing conflict here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 376.94,
          "end": 378.37,
          "en": "after the colon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 378.37,
          "end": 380.89300000000003,
          "en": "you have to use the same different name here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 382.2,
          "end": 383.033,
          "en": "So with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 383.033,
          "end": 387.36,
          "en": "we got our team Id and I'm storing it in an extra constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 387.36,
          "end": 391.13,
          "en": "And we can now use the team Id to find the correct team",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 391.13,
          "end": 393.42,
          "en": "in this injected team's array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 393.42,
          "end": 397.47,
          "en": "So here I got the selected team, let's say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 397.47,
          "end": 400.12,
          "en": "by accessing teams, this.teams.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 400.12,
          "end": 402.03,
          "en": "So the injected teams array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 402.03,
          "end": 403.87,
          "en": "and then their defined method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 403.87,
          "end": 405.86,
          "en": "which is a built in array method,",
